# Experiment run outputs (large/regeneratable; code lives in experiments/wp01, experiments/wp02)
experiments/WP-01/
experiments/WP-02/comparison-plots-001/
experiments/WP-02/full-synthetic-001/
experiments/WP-02/grid-sweep-001/
